  "summary": "The saved mask comes from C14: per-cell pools (\u00b15 days around 1992\u20132002 dates) give a hazen 90th-percentile threshold, smoothed with a wrap-around cumulative-sum 31-day mean; it is compared with all 92 target days for every sea cell, then the hot-run and gap-joining logic is applied and the result is written at L233. Because the cumsum-difference smoothing evaluated for target days 153\u2013244 depends arithmetically on raw threshold days 352\u2013366 and 1\u2013259, the baseline values reaching the mask are Jan 1\u2013Sep 20 and Dec 12\u201331 of each year. The windows also pull in 1991-12-27..31 and 2003-01-01..05; the climatology is not on the mask path."
